{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:35e203f5cf216d85","name":"Borg Construct AJ-6","source":{"id":"source:reference-35e203f5cf216d85","title":"Borg Construct AJ-6","revision":16338,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:43Z","sha256":"27a0bbb6e978e2360fb7534223a72befbbf481d60c32bbb82f12e05bc42bd1b8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16338","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Borg%20Construct%20AJ-6&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-35e203f5cf216d85","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 80,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Installation Cost:"]}," 70,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rejection Attack Bonus:"]}," +14\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The BioTech Borg Construct AJ-6 provides a direct cabled or wireless link to computers and networks within a 10-meter range. It allows a cyborg to remotely program and access on-board data through thought alone. The standard model has a built-in cybord/Droid interface and up to four BioTech Knowledge Cartridges or standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datacard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datacard","referenceId":"reference:1c6be65fe354ef04"}," ports (at 500 credits per port beyond the first). Knowledge Cartridges use proprietary technology to achieve ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," 4 (instead of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," 2 for a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datacard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datacard","referenceId":"reference:1c6be65fe354ef04"},"), cost 100 credits each, and are not widely available. BioTech Borg Construct AJ-6s cannot be self-installed.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Characters wearing a BioTech Borg Construct AJ-6 gain a +2 beneficial circumstance bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge","referenceId":"reference:dcb3e1c00e79236d"},", and other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," at the discretion of the Gamemaster. They can also use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Issue Routine Commands"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Issue_Routine_Commands"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," (or as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," if they have the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Gimmick"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gimmick"}]}," Talent). Wearers become more computerlike and less able to relate to people, causing them to take a -5 penalty to all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks. They also speak less frequently as they grow accustomed to the speed of communicating through electronic networks.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
